Problem statement:
Aryan and his friends are very fond of patterns. For a given integer ‘N’, they want to make the Increasing Letter Triangle.
Example:

Input: ‘N’ = 3

Output: 

A
A B
A B C


Solution:

public class Solution {
    public static void nLetterTriangle(int n) {
        

        for (int i=1; i<=n; i++){
            char c= 'A';
            for (int j=1; j<=i; j++){

                System.out.print(c+ " ");
                c++;
            }
            System.out.println();
        }
    }
}

